WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Learn anything. Your way.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Axon, the self-hosted life OS for self-learners.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.200
Your day, at a glance. Your roadmap, tasks, habits, and goals in one view.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.400
Your own roadmap. Set up a personal roadmap for your self-learning journey.

5
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.600
Grow hard and soft skills. Your knowledge, domain by domain, as it grows.

6
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.800
Do what matters. GTD and Kanban, without the clutter.

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:28.000
Think in connections. A Zettelkasten graph of your notes.

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.200
Draw. Write maths. Sketches and LaTeX in every note, and in your vault.

9
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.400
Remember for good. Spaced repetition that measures your memory.

10
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.600
Ask Jarvis. One agent that asks all the others for you.

11
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.800
Watch your field. News, videos in a few words, podcasts, connected.

12
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.000
Everything you enjoy. Films, series, books, and games, with their covers.

13
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.200
Feel better. Water, coffee, sleep, and what helps you.

14
00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:57.400
Know your money. Where it went and where it came from, month by month.

15
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:01.600
Collect your progress. Trophies for your roadmaps, goals, projects, and habits.

16
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:06.600
Everything. In one place.

17
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.600
Private by design. On your server.

18
00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:15.600
Axon. Open source. Try the demo.
